WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.621
It was Christmas Eve.

2
00:00:02.622 --> 00:00:06.707
Billy and his sister, Lindsey, were playing hide and seek.

3
00:00:06.708 --> 00:00:09.886
Billy was looking for a place to hide.

4
00:00:09.887 --> 00:00:15.410
". . . 53, 54, 55, 56 . . ."

5
00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:23.018
"Oh, no! I can't go in there. Mom is busy making pies," said Billy.

6
00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:28.467
". . . 60, 61, 62, 63 . . ."

7
00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:36.656
"Oh, no! I can't go in there either!" he said in a whisper.

8
00:00:36.657 --> 00:00:41.625
Billy's father was Doctor Vinton, a famous animal doctor.

9
00:00:41.626 --> 00:00:46.277
He was talking on the phone. He looked very worried.

10
00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:52.116
Billy knew he shouldn't bother his father. "You say they're sick?

11
00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:59.499
All of them? What's wrong with them?" asked Billy's father.

12
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:04.620
". . . 67, 68, 69, 70 . . ."

13
00:01:04.621 --> 00:01:09.790
Billy ran upstairs. He ran into his parents' bedroom.

14
00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:15.527
"She always checks under the bed," Billy said to himself.

15
00:01:15.528 --> 00:01:21.889
"She always checks in the closets too," he whispered.

16
00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.445
"But she never looks in my father's luggage.

17
00:01:25.446 --> 00:01:30.827
I'll hide in there," said Billy happily.

18
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:38.632
". . . 98, 99, 100. Ready or not, here I come!" shouted Lindsey.

19
00:01:38.633 --> 00:01:45.871
It was dark and warm in his father's luggage. Billy soon fell asleep.

20
00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:53.306
Downstairs, Billy's father had just finished his telephone call with Santa Claus.

21
00:01:53.307 --> 00:02:02.539
Santa Claus had called to tell him that his reindeer were very sick—so sick that they couldn't fly.

22
00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.714
"They're sending a car to take me to the airport.

23
00:02:05.715 --> 00:02:10.667
It should be here in a few minutes," said Doctor Vinton to his wife.

24
00:02:10.668 --> 00:02:14.894
"What should I tell the kids?" asked his wife.

25
00:02:14.895 --> 00:02:21.909
"Tell them that some animals are very sick, and I need to help them," he said.

26
00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.633
There was a loud knock on the door.

27
00:02:24.634 --> 00:02:29.479
A man in a dark suit and dark glasses walked in.

28
00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:33.922
"Doctor Vinton, I've been sent by the president," said the gentleman.

29
00:02:33.923 --> 00:02:38.791
"Are you ready?" he asked.

30
00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:42.951
"Yes," said Billy's father. "I have a bag packed.

31
00:02:42.952 --> 00:02:46.779
It's upstairs in the closet. Can you get it for me?

32
00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:51.401
I will get my instruments and some medicine from my office."

33
00:02:51.402 --> 00:02:56.403
The man nodded and went upstairs. He found the bag in the closet.

34
00:02:56.404 --> 00:03:01.886
"Wow! This bag is heavy," said the man.

35
00:03:01.887 --> 00:03:05.290
The man took the suitcase and put it in the car.

36
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:10.206
Billy's father joined the man in the car, and they drove to the airport.

37
00:03:10.207 --> 00:03:19.937
At the airport, the president's plane was waiting to take Doctor Vinton to the North Pole.

38
00:03:19.938 --> 00:03:25.998
When Billy woke up, he wasn't sure where he was. He was very surprised.

39
00:03:25.999 --> 00:03:33.586
He saw his father speaking with Santa Claus. "Daddy! Daddy!" called Billy.

40
00:03:33.587 --> 00:03:42.151
"Where are we? And why are you talking to Santa Claus?"

41
00:03:42.152 --> 00:03:46.041
Billy's father was even more surprised than Billy.

42
00:03:46.042 --> 00:03:52.575
"What? How . . . how did you get here?" asked Billy's father in amazement.

43
00:03:52.576 --> 00:03:57.614
"I was playing hide-and-seek with Lindsey. I hid in your suitcase.

44
00:03:57.615 --> 00:04:04.313
She didn't find me so I guess I won!" shouted Billy excitedly.

45
00:04:04.314 --> 00:04:13.872
Santa Claus smiled and said, "Yes, Billy, you won, but your father and I are very busy.

46
00:04:13.873 --> 00:04:20.817
My reindeer are sick, and he needs to find out how to make them better.

47
00:04:20.818 --> 00:04:32.419
Will you be a good boy and help my elves?"

